<title>SPAIN: Spanish bonds fall after auction results.</title>
<headline>Spanish bonds fall after auction results.</headline>
<text>
<p>1030 GMT - Government bonds extend losses after Treasury auctions, but then partially bounce back. Yields slightly higher than secondary market, and amount sold higher than expected.</p>
<p>* 10-yr 7.35 pct T-bond 106.69 vs 106.96, yield 6.39 vs 6.36</p>
<p>* Sept bond future 116.33 vs 116.58 at Monday's close</p>
<p>* Peseta/mark 84.52/54 vs 84.49/52</p>
